  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業與競爭分析",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY & COMPETITION ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "產業競爭分析在探討產業的生命週期各階段的競爭優勢及因應策略。透過本課程，同學能學習到：1.運用產業分析的工具與技巧，培養系統性之分析與規劃能力。2.分析產業生命週期各階段的競爭策略。3.能運用理論知識、觀念能力及適當之方法、工具，對企業之發展方向及資源分配進行整體性、前瞻性之理解與思考。",
    "describe_eh": "Industry and Competitiveness Analysis studies the competitive advantages and strategies for a industry in various product life cycle stages.  Students will learn to (1) the application of industry analysis tools and skills, and training of systematic analysis and planning abilities.  (2) analyze the competitive strategies for a industry in different product life cycle stages.  (3) use theoretic knowledge and proper methodology to comprehend and consider the industry development direction, resources allocation and perspectives.",
    "pre_subname": "MGT1001管理學、MGT1002企業概論",
    "pre_sub_id3": "MGT1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "MGT1001 MANAGEMENT、MGT1002 INTRODUCTION TO BUSINESS",
